div.p:
Considering, that in order to fulfill the purposes of the treaty concluded
                    between Haiti and the United States on September 16, 1915, a protocol was
                    concluded between the two Governments on October 3, 1919;

Considering, that in an exchange of notes between the two Governments, certain
                    modifications of the protocol were accepted and confirmed in the notes of the
                    1st and 3rd of June, 1922;

Considering, that in order to arrive at a revision of the customs tariff and to
                    diminish the taxes actually borne by the mass of the people, it is necessary to
                    release the public revenues from the pledges now existing;
